{
  "description": "Fresh advanced-figure computation. Raw source texts/IDs and fixed selections only; no archived generated activations. See MAPS.md for exact algorithms, access, and provenance limits.",
  "external_requirements": [
    "HF_TOKEN with gated Meta Llama model access",
    "Public HF model and Wikipedia downloads",
    "git and uv available; wrapper fetches pinned author source and isolated historical Python3.10 requirements"
  ],
  "exactness_limitations": [
    "Bubble original FineWeb document IDs, dataset revision and sentence selection code were not retained; included raw sentence list permits fresh computation, not independent corpus reconstruction.",
    "Bubble original model revision was not recorded; default is the pinned Llama3.1 snapshot used elsewhere.",
    "Language speed regions are freshly computed; original editorial source labels are applied by token ID with a hard error for unknown tokens or mismatched contexts.",
    "Full-scale GPU output agreement is unverified."
  ],
